/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 130 0 R
/E (The growing number of job applications has made manual resume screening time-consuming, inefficient, and prone to bias. HR professionals face information overload, increasing the risk of missing qualified candidates.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 130 0 R
/E (Traditional ATS systems rely on exact keyword matching, lacking semantic understanding and often rejecting candidates who use synonymous terms. These systems are also vulnerable to keyword stuffing. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
