173 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 132 0 R
/E (The proposed system is an Explainable AI-based resume screening solution that uses LLaMA to understand resumes and job descriptions based on meaning rather than keywords. It generates semantic embeddings, ranks candidates using similarity scores, and provides clear explanations for each decision. This approach improves efficiency, accuracy, and fairness in the recruitment process.)
